    "1–4 场" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1–4 games"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1–9 级，每级再分 −、本级、+ 三档，共 27 档。3–6 级一级比一级多一个维度：技术会不会 → 主动球好不好 → 被动球能不能摆脱、战术 → 在俱乐部里的位置。每级可以展开看分项标准（步法、发力、前后场、攻防）。对照“能稳定做到”的，而不是偶尔打出来的球；7 起是州级、全国、国际水平，只看能查到的赛果、排名和证书。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Levels 1–9, each split into three tiers (−, base, +), for 27 tiers in total. Each level from 3 to 6 adds one more dimension: can you do the shots → how good are your attacking shots → can you get out of trouble on defensive shots, plus tactics → where you stand in your club. Expand any level to see its skill breakdown (footwork, power, front and back court, attack and defense). Judge by what you can do consistently, not shots you pull off once in a while. 7 and up means state, national, and international level, based only on verifiable results, rankings, and certificates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 小时后开打" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starts in 2 hours"
