    "临时局：只找 %@ 内此刻也在找人的球友，找到后要在 5–10 分钟内确认，建议打开上面的开关。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last-minute game: we only look for players within %@ who are also searching right now. Once someone's found, you'll have 5–10 minutes to confirm, so we recommend turning on the switch above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "临时局：找到人后需要在 5–10 分钟内确认，最晚开赛前 20 分钟约成。到点没约成会自动结束，不计入任何记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last-minute game: once players are found, confirm within 5–10 minutes. The game must be set at least 20 minutes before start. If it isn't, the request ends automatically and won't go on your record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为了不让别人白等，这个请求先暂停了。还想打的话点“继续找”，不影响任何记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "So no one waits for nothing, we've paused this request. Still want to play? Tap “Keep looking”. This won't affect your record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主动球全部不错（所有分项到 4 级，包括反手），双打有基本意识；但被动球、极限球做不到" : {
