          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moves opponents around with placement and pace: pushing deep, dropping short"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会跑去接，但没有固定步法" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runs for the shuttle, but without set footwork"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会通知其他球友。开赛 2 小时前取消不影响履约记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Other players will be notified. Canceling more than 2 hours before start won't affect your reliability record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "但被动球、极限球基本做不到，一被压就丢分" : {
