    "分项标准参考中羽在线论坛流传的 1–9 级分项描述；1–6 级还参考了打球吧“业余 1–9 级”和 USTA NTRP；7 起按 tournamentsoftware 公开成绩、USAB 全国排名、《运动员技术等级标准》（2025 版）和 BWF 世界排名划分。中国羽协的业余等级是“九级最低”，方向和这里相反；美国各赛事的组别强度不同，所以按“最高组 / 次高组”的相对位置认定。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The skill breakdowns are based on the level 1–9 descriptions widely shared on the Zhongyu Online forum; levels 1–6 also draw on Daqiuba's “Amateur Levels 1–9” and USTA NTRP. Levels 7 and up are based on public results on tournamentsoftware, USAB national rankings, China's Athlete Technical Grade Standards (2025 edition), and the BWF World Ranking. The Chinese Badminton Association's amateur levels run the other way (“Level 9 is the lowest”). Flight strength varies across US tournaments, so we go by relative position: top flight / second flight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分项标准（%lld 项）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skill breakdown (%lld)"
