          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Knows arm vs. wrist power; basic grasp of pronation and supination"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能吊过网，但常偏高、偏远" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drops clear the net but are often high or long"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能回到对方中后场，但不能底线到底线；反手吊不稳" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reaches the opponent's mid-to-back court but not baseline to baseline; backhand drop is inconsistent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
