    "能挡回去，但没有速度" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can block it back, but without pace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能杀下去、有角度，但对方不难接" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smashes go down with angle, but aren't hard to return"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能正确挥拍但常出错，回球只到中场或略偏后" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Correct swing but frequent errors; returns only reach midcourt or a bit deeper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能用上手腕和内外旋，但力量有限" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uses wrist and pronation/supination, but with limited power"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能用反手打，但只到中场" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can hit backhand, but only to midcourt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能组织进攻，但速度和角度一般，很难一拍致命" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can build attacks, but average speed and angles make winners rare"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能连续对拉十几拍，但实战一快就失误多" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can rally 10+ shots, but errors pile up when play speeds up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能针对不同对手提前定打法，并在场上执行" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plans a game plan for each opponent and executes it on court"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "能防住不是绝对机会的杀球并控制落点，对方杀得一般时能反抽" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
