    "被动球、极限球有时能过渡出来：回到对方后场或网前，让自己回位" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sometimes recovers from defensive and stretched shots: returns to the opponent's back court or net to get back in position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "被动球、极限球有机会摆脱：被压到底线、调到死角也能过渡出来" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can escape defensive and stretched shots: recovers even when pushed to the baseline or into corners"
          }
        }
      }
    },
