          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问卷最高 6+，球友评价最多到 7−。7 起（州级以上）只看能公开查到的证据：赛事成绩、全国排名或运动员等级证书、BWF 世界排名。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The assessment goes up to 6+, and player reviews up to 7−. Level 7 and up (state level and above) requires publicly verifiable evidence: tournament results, national ranking or athlete grade certificate, or BWF world ranking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问卷最高到 6+（俱乐部顶尖）；7 起是州级以上，凭赛果、全国排名、运动员等级证书或 BWF 世界排名认证。打满 5 场后会按球友评价自动校准。" : {
